{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fc9913e591d83782aeccdc782961f2cc5776c53c80f233abc96d83aa9df50a21", "ja": "（ん？　控え室がやけに蒸し暑い……。うわっ、\nなんでエアコンの設定温度がこんなに高いんだ？）", "zh": "（嗯？准备室怎么这么闷热……哇！\n为什么空调温度设定得这么高？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "40c6859d7f3dee24a0544f7eae7dd15994d115029f74fb4d900835315834032f", "ja": "あ、エアコン止めたらダメだよ、兄ちゃん。\n真美が今、次の公演のコト考えてるんだから～！", "zh": "啊，不可以关掉空调喔，大哥哥。\n真美正在想下次公演的事情～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3fda96ea65cfd5bea2482671fb0f292e2ea2297ecb5bcf77c52df11d8424c5d1", "ja": "なんだって！？　真美にいったい何が……！？\nというか、なんで室温を上げる必要があるんだ？", "zh": "什么！？真美究竟吃错什么药了……！？\n话说回来，有必要调高室温吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "8dbf0de60aac094ed09792aef67c594dec7ef0631f6695330bcf3eaad9aea2e5", "ja": "ほら、昔からよく言うっしょ？\nジャングルのことは、ジャングルに聞けと！", "zh": "自古以来不是有句俗话这么说吗？\n丛林的事情问丛林最清楚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "41d5d347445e69b27b4137ee167168c1ac15870c23a2a97c966aa6797f12b9af", "ja": "いや、聞いたことないけど。", "zh": "抱歉，我从来没听过这句话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "c0b5657b5aea743f009fe8167335c553053c652d9ff07dd7018d1dd12c338f55", "ja": "つまりだね、兄ちゃん君。真美は考えたのだよ。\nまた劇場でジャングル☆パーティーを歌いたいと！", "zh": "也就是说呢，大哥哥，真美是这么想的……\n真美想要在剧场再唱一次丛林☆派对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "61db32dbf7ad66ba08a4a95b3136b5397457b836972c8df6b40500aa5f6afd5e", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか。確かに、真美と環の\nジャングル☆パーティー公演は大盛り上がりだったな！", "zh": "喔，原来是这样。\n先前真美和环的丛林☆派对公演确实盛况空前呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "8b4bdfa651baff3f46624197e4f2ddde3c8868ddf0b2092d0be059591203e2db", "ja": "でしょ！？　というわけで、真美はジャングル気分に\nひたりながら、次の公演のプリンを焼いてたんだよ！", "zh": "对吧！？所以啦，真美就这样一边沉浸在丛林氛围中，\n一边烤着下次公演的地瓜喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a239402af6e0e573cf7793d7a599a86edefd12b679f97047e5a8485784627f49", "ja": "……プランを練ってたんだな？\nそれで、いいアイデアは思いついたか？", "zh": "……你是想说考虑公演的计划吧？\n所以呢？有想到什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "0946088a8bbe6589b9e1bc686323169c38cd1ed2854251f9bef96440367eb854", "ja": "うんっ！　やっぱジャングルっていうからには、\nゴリラとか呼ばなきゃダメっしょ？", "zh": "嗯！既然是丛林，\n一定要请大猩猩登场才行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "03cb0734a2677a9a5719e934c35a30dde52381a52919c100ade391251c1d0d29", "ja": "ダメ……かな？", "zh": "一定……要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "7f4e6764da932a5ee0e0713922c21b705de2d9e9e09af8f054d6a98e36e18c28", "ja": "ダメなのー！　夢の中にも出てきたんだかんね！", "zh": "一定要啦──！大猩猩还特地托梦给真美喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "cd0246c170ab46fd7a45a7b6b360d70b5cb4ce970b115ab7dbc08ecb9c747001", "ja": "でもさー、ひびきんに聞いても「動物園になら親友が\nいるけど、そこらへんにはいないぞ！」って。", "zh": "不过啊，响仔说「本人是有住在动物园的大猩猩朋友，\n但大猩猩可不是到处都找得到喔！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2c20fbc6ce3872fd5f67274f4c64bdabb5357ecec764c3e7314376cb03e29101", "ja": "……そりゃそうだろうなぁ。", "zh": "……我想也是啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "222e062f23961e08067f8fd20129943691140900e3e549d2532b483ddf29d824", "ja": "せめて誰かがゴリラの着ぐるみを着て、\nステージでウホウホしてくれればいいんだけどなー。", "zh": "不然起码找个人穿上大猩猩的布偶装，\n在舞台上呜吼呜吼叫也可以啊──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "18df449ad1c571fb37b60628115266875536eadb3e712c600236003220c81ddf", "ja": "兄ちゃん。中身が女の子だと、\nやっぱゴリラっぽくならないんだよ？", "zh": "大哥哥，要是找女孩子来，\n可是演不出大猩猩的样子喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0e232c4c6333859587a705b3f70f6faea73991dac379ad1e7a041fb0e7e6af44", "ja": "真美。いっておくけど俺の仕事は裏方というか、\nアイドルをステージに送り出すことであって……", "zh": "真美，我要先声明，我是做幕后工作的，\n只负责将偶像送上舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "e9c1f84bcfbadab777afa909dd3688c74bfc45fd3f4b3d55de6eb1f7d6b47f72", "ja": "兄ちゃんがそばにいてくれると、\n真美、めっちゃステージで輝ける気がする！", "zh": "如果有大哥哥陪着，\n真美在舞台上应该能更闪耀喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1022_p", "source_sha256": "95d37f5af66bb3a16135d749fd7101551a116779a07ee00f91bc8c1dbc267fa8", "ja": "真美。いっておくけどゴリラの着ぐるみなんて、\n劇場には……", "zh": "真美，我要先声明，\n这座剧场里可没有什么大猩猩布偶装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "d8351f45963f192710459c58c0eccf50ecf53134d35eaeb02e1dc8b8ab36d35d", "ja": "ロコロコがね、さっき「ノープロブレムです！」って\nはりきってたんだよ！", "zh": "ROCOROCO她刚才干劲十足地\n跟真美说「No Problem」喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_1026", "source_sha256": "2d778202a7dedb7ce953bba9f6b185369fe1342719356235f6c4308330d521a2", "ja": "（やれやれ…）", "zh": "（真是的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_2000_012mam", "source_sha256": "9ceabc41891cd310ed9369266fa314ea4a63a8a1fc320b29d6d327d3213db32d", "ja": "わーい、ありがと兄ちゃん♪　さあ、またまた\n忙しくなってきたぜ！　おーい、たまきち～！", "zh": "耶──！谢谢大哥哥♪\n好，又要忙起来啦！喂──阿环～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0093_2001_p", "source_sha256": "b56b5cf38dcd18f466fdec5a088b134d5ac3962f938b7032fbc3874175ab6d05", "ja": "って、まだ何も言ってないだろ！？\n待て、待つんだ真美！　やっぱりちょっと……真美ー！", "zh": "不对，我什么都还没说啊！！\n等等，等一下真美！我还是不太……真美──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
